    "detailed_description": "&quot;Math Seeker&quot; is a puzzle game of pushing boxes which integrates mathematical elements. The core gameplay revolves around arranging boxes to form the desired mathematical expressions and then pushing those boxes for evaluation. Of course, some levels have unique and ingenious ways to win.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147770/extras/f43559709cdf5852020ede8e2daca9ca.avif?t=1725625558\" width=244 height=304 /></span><br><br>The game is divided into five chapters, featuring nearly a hundred levels. It gradually introduces new boxes and mechanisms, following a mathematical thread that leads from arithmetic to geometry and functions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147770/extras/50564cb28301699608b06e4ef73adc68.avif?t=1725625558\" width=306 height=246 /></span><br><br>The game supports an editing function, allowing players to create levels and share them with others through Steam Workshop.",
